%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Merchant
    participant P as SignInPage<br/>SignInCubit
    participant B as AuthBloc
    participant R as AuthRepository<br/>(Either<Failure, T>)
    participant S as Qorelly Supabase Auth
    participant A as apps/api

    Note over B: App start: AuthStarted
    B->>R: currentUser() (restored supabase_flutter session)
    R-->>B: Right(null) → Unauthenticated / Right(user) → Authenticated
    U->>P: email + password, tap Sign in
    P->>R: SignIn use case
    R->>S: signInWithPassword
    alt failure
        S-->>R: AuthException
        R-->>P: Left(AuthFailure)
        P-->>U: inline error
    else success
        S-->>R: session
        R-->>P: Right(MerchantUser)
        P->>B: AuthUserChanged(user)
        B-->>U: HomePage
    end
    U->>A: any API call via Dio
    Note right of U: interceptor adds Bearer currentSession.accessToken
